{
  "sourceLanguage": "fr",
  "strings": {
    "Tour des Tuileries": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tuileries Loop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Du Louvre à la Concorde — 2,5 km": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From the Louvre to Concorde — 2.5 km"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pyramide du Louvre": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Louvre Pyramid"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Départ face à la pyramide de verre. Les cours du palais s'ouvrent sur un des musées les plus visités au monde.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starting point facing the glass pyramid. The palace courtyards open onto one of the most visited museums in the world."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bassin octogonal": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Octagonal Basin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Centre géométrique du jardin. Les chaises vertes, les enfants aux voiliers, le soleil sur l'eau — Paris au ralenti.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The garden's geometric centerpiece. Green chairs, children with toy sailboats, sunlight on the water — Paris in slow motion."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Place de la Concorde": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Place de la Concorde"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L'obélisque de Louxor marque l'arrivée. La plus grande place de Paris s'ouvre sur les Champs-Élysées à l'ouest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Luxor obelisk marks the finish. Paris's largest square opens onto the Champs-Élysées to the west."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Berges de la Seine": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seine Riverbanks"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notre-Dame → Tour Eiffel — 5 km": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notre-Dame → Eiffel Tower — 5 km"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notre-Dame de Paris": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notre-Dame de Paris"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Départ face au parvis de la cathédrale, sur l'Île de la Cité. La Seine coule de chaque côté.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starting point facing the cathedral square, on the Île de la Cité. The Seine flows on both sides."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pont des Arts": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pont des Arts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le pont piéton aux anciens cadenas d'amour. Vue dégagée sur l'Institut de France et le Louvre.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The pedestrian bridge once covered in love padlocks. Open view of the Institut de France and the Louvre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tour Eiffel": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eiffel Tower"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La dame de fer vue depuis le Champ-de-Mars. Depuis les berges, elle apparaît d'un coup au détour du pont de l'Alma.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The iron lady seen from the Champ-de-Mars. From the riverbanks, she suddenly appears past the Pont de l'Alma."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Boucle de Central Park": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Central Park Loop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le grand tour du parc new-yorkais — 10 km": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The grand tour of New York's park — 10 km"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grand Army Plaza": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grand Army Plaza"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Entrée sud du parc, à deux pas du Plaza Hotel. Les calèches attendent, les gratte-ciel de Midtown encadrent les premiers arbres.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The park's southern entrance, steps from the Plaza Hotel. Horse-drawn carriages wait, Midtown skyscrapers frame the first trees."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bethesda Fountain": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bethesda Fountain"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La fontaine de l'Ange des Eaux, cœur romantique du parc. Les terrasses donnent sur le lac et ses barques.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Angel of the Waters fountain, the park's romantic heart. Terraces overlook the lake and its rowboats."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Harlem Meer": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Harlem Meer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lac tranquille à l'angle nord-est, loin de l'agitation touristique. Les colverts y hivernent, les New-Yorkais y pêchent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A quiet lake at the northeast corner, far from the tourist bustle. Mallards winter here, New Yorkers fish here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strawberry Fields": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Strawberry Fields"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mosaïque « Imagine » en hommage à John Lennon, qui habitait le Dakota Building juste en face. Bouclage du tour.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The ‘Imagine’ mosaic honoring John Lennon, who lived right across the street at the Dakota Building. The loop closes here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Semi-marathon de Paris": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paris Half Marathon"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hôtel de Ville → Champs-Élysées — 21 km": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "City Hall → Champs-Élysées — 21 km"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hôtel de Ville": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "City Hall"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Départ sur le parvis. La Seine est à deux pas, les bâtiments haussmanniens bordent les premiers kilomètres.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starting point on the square. The Seine is steps away, Haussmann-era buildings line the first kilometers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bois de Vincennes": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vincennes Woods"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le poumon vert de l'est parisien. Les allées forestières offrent un répit après les boulevards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eastern Paris's green lung. Forest paths offer a break from the boulevards."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Place de la Nation": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Place de la Nation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La grande place ronde marque le retour vers le centre. Les jambes commencent à parler.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The great round square marks the turn back toward the center. Legs start to complain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Champs-Élysées": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Champs-Élysées"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arrivée sur la plus belle avenue du monde. 21,1 km dans les jambes et tout Paris pour récompense.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finish on the most beautiful avenue in the world. 21.1 km in the legs, and all of Paris as a reward."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Marathon de Paris": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paris Marathon"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La boucle mythique — 42 km": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The legendary loop — 42 km"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Départ au pied de l'Arc de Triomphe. Des dizaines de milliers de coureurs s'élancent chaque année en avril.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starting point at the foot of the Arc de Triomphe. Tens of thousands of runners set off every year in April."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bois de Boulogne": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Boulogne Woods"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Première grande bouffée d'air vert. Les allées du bois absorbent les premiers kilomètres dans leurs feuillages.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "First big breath of green air. The woods' pathways absorb the first kilometers in their foliage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mi-parcours — Bastille": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Halfway Point — Bastille"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La moitié est franchie. La place de la Bastille et ses colonnes marquent le point de bascule mental du marathon.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The halfway mark. Place de la Bastille and its column mark the marathon's mental turning point."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le redoutable km 30 — le mur du marathon. Les arbres du bois sont là pour souffler avant le retour.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The dreaded km 30 — the marathon wall. The woods' trees are there to help you catch your breath before the return."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avenue Foch": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avenue Foch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L'arrivée. 42,195 km parcourus à travers Paris. La médaille, les jambes en feu, et la fierté qui ne passe pas.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The finish. 42.195 km covered across Paris. The medal, legs on fire, and pride that never fades."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Amélie Poulain — Montmartre": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amélie Poulain — Montmartre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Café des Deux Moulins → Canal Saint-Martin — 4 km": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Café des Deux Moulins → Canal Saint-Martin — 4 km"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Café des Deux Moulins": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Café des Deux Moulins"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Amélie y est serveuse. On la voit casser la croûte brûlée de la crème brûlée avec le dos de sa cuillère.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amélie works here as a waitress. We see her crack the burnt top of a crème brûlée with the back of her spoon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Épicerie Collignon": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Épicerie Collignon"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Amélie s'en prend à l'épicier tyrannique : pantoufles réarrangées, réveil déréglé, petite vengeance discrète.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amélie targets the tyrannical grocer: rearranged slippers, a reset alarm clock, a small quiet act of revenge."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Marché Saint-Pierre": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marché Saint-Pierre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le quartier textile qu'elle traverse en chemin, entre les rouleaux de tissus empilés sur les trottoirs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The textile district she crosses along the way, past bolts of fabric stacked on the sidewalks."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Son appartement, passage des Abbesses": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Her Apartment, Passage des Abbesses"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Là où elle vit, observe le monde par sa fenêtre et invente ses petits complots bienveillants.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Where she lives, watches the world through her window, and dreams up her small acts of kindness."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le Consulat": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le Consulat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le café où travaille Nino, qu'elle épie de loin avant d'oser l'approcher.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The café where Nino works, whom she spies on from a distance before daring to approach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Parvis du Sacré-Cœur": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sacré-Cœur Square"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vue sur tout Paris. Un des lieux de rendez-vous les plus emblématiques du film.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A view over all of Paris. One of the film's most iconic meeting spots."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ricochets sur le Canal Saint-Martin": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Skipping Stones on Canal Saint-Martin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Amélie fait des ricochets, seule, dans un des instants les plus contemplatifs du film.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amélie skips stones, alone, in one of the film's most contemplative moments."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Canal Saint-Martin": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Canal Saint-Martin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fin du parcours au bord de l'eau, dans la lumière si particulière du Paris d'Amélie.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The route ends by the water, in the light so particular to Amélie's Paris."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before Sunrise — Vienne de nuit": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before Sunrise — Vienna by Night"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gare de Vienne → Pont sur le Danube — 7 km": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vienna Train Station → Danube Bridge — 7 km"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gare de Vienne": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vienna Train Station"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jesse et Céline descendent du train ensemble, sur un coup de tête qui va changer une nuit — et peut-être une vie.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jesse and Céline get off the train together, on a whim that will change one night — and maybe a life."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tram nocturne": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Night Tram"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Première vraie conversation, premières confidences, à travers les vitres embuées d'un tramway viennois.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first real conversation, first confidences, through the fogged-up windows of a Viennese tram."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Café Sperl": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Café Sperl"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discussion existentielle autour d'un café viennois — l'amour, le temps, la peur de se rater.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An existential conversation over a Viennese coffee — love, time, the fear of missing out."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disquaire, cabine d'écoute": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Record Store, Listening Booth"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le moment gênant et tendre où ils écoutent un disque ensemble, sans jamais oser se regarder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The awkward, tender moment where they listen to a record together, never quite daring to look at each other."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cimetière central de Vienne": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vienna Central Cemetery"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Déambulation parmi les tombes, réflexions à voix haute sur le temps qui passe et la mort qui attend.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wandering among the graves, thinking aloud about passing time and waiting death."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Petit parc au bord du Danube": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Small Park by the Danube"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Un slam improvisé par un inconnu du parc, pour une poignée de pièces — un des instants les plus tendres du film.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An impromptu slam poem from a stranger in the park, for a handful of coins — one of the film's tenderest moments."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grande roue du Prater": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prater Ferris Wheel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Premier baiser, suspendu dans une cabine au-dessus des lumières de Vienne.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "First kiss, suspended in a cabin above the lights of Vienna."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pont sur le Danube": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Danube Bridge"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L'aube approche. La promesse fragile de se retrouver, six mois plus tard, sur ce même quai.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dawn approaches. The fragile promise to meet again, six months later, on this same platform."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notting Hill — Portobello Road": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notting Hill — Portobello Road"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Librairie de William → Hôtel Ritz — 3 km": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "William's Bookshop → The Ritz — 3 km"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Librairie de voyage de William": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "William's Travel Bookshop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anna Scott y entre par hasard, incognito, et bouleverse sans le savoir la vie tranquille d'un libraire.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anna Scott walks in by chance, incognito, unknowingly turning a quiet bookseller's life upside down."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Portobello Market": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Portobello Market"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La traversée du marché au fil des saisons, en un seul plan-séquence devenu culte.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The market crossed through the changing seasons, in a single cult-favorite tracking shot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le café du coin": {
