      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Col de Vergio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Point le plus haut atteint par une route en Corse, entre forêts de pins laricio et estives. Le sentier bascule vers le centre de l'île.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The highest point reached by a road in Corsica, between laricio pine forests and summer pastures. The trail swings toward the island's center."
          }
        }
      }
    },
