      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Manganu Hut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Au bord des pozzines, ces pelouses spongieuses gorgées d'eau. Les lacs glaciaires de Nino et Capitellu ne sont plus loin.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "By the pozzines, those spongy, waterlogged meadows. The glacial lakes of Nino and Capitellu are not far now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
