      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prati Hut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vaste replat herbeux ouvert sur la mer Tyrrhénienne à l'est. Le sud, plus doux, commence à se dessiner.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A vast grassy plateau opening onto the Tyrrhenian Sea to the east. The gentler south begins to take shape."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refuge d'Usciolu": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usciolu Hut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Perché sur l'arête, réputé pour ses couchers de soleil. La redoutable « arête a Monda » attend au sud.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Perched on the ridge, famous for its sunsets. The fearsome ‘arête a Monda’ awaits to the south."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refuge d'Asinau": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asinau Hut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sous les aiguilles de Bavella, cathédrales de granit orange. L'un des plus beaux décors de toute la traversée.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beneath the Bavella needles, cathedrals of orange granite. One of the most beautiful sights of the entire crossing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refuge de Paliri": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paliri Hut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dernier refuge avant l'arrivée, dans les pins et le maquis. La mer est déjà là, en contrebas.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last hut before the finish, among the pines and maquis. The sea is already visible below."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conca": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conca"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arrivée au bout du GR20, village perché au-dessus de Porto-Vecchio. La mer Méditerranée scintille au loin.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrival at the end of the GR20, a village perched above Porto-Vecchio. The Mediterranean Sea sparkles in the distance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Camino Francés — tronçon final": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Camino Francés — Final Stretch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
