      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Morgade"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hameau minuscule où se dresse la fameuse borne des 100 kilomètres. À partir d'ici, chaque pas rapproche vraiment de Santiago.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A tiny hamlet home to the famous 100-kilometer marker. From here, every step truly brings you closer to Santiago."
          }
        }
      }
    },
