      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Portomarín"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Village reconstruit après que l'ancien fut noyé sous le lac de Belesar dans les années 1960.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A village rebuilt after the old one was flooded under Lake Belesar in the 1960s."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eirexe": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eirexe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Petit lieu-dit galicien parmi les hórreos, ces greniers de pierre sur pilotis. La campagne défile au rythme des vaches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A small Galician hamlet among hórreos, those stone granaries on stilts. The countryside rolls by to the rhythm of grazing cows."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Palas de Rei": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Palas de Rei"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nom lié aux rois wisigoths. Étape tranquille à mi-chemin du tronçon final, cœur de la Galice verte.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A name tied to the Visigothic kings. A quiet stage at the midpoint of the final stretch, in the heart of green Galicia."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Melide": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Melide"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Étape gourmande, capitale du poulpe à la galicienne — le pulpo á feira. Les pèlerins s'y attablent avant la dernière ligne.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A stage for food lovers, capital of Galician-style octopus — pulpo á feira. Pilgrims sit down here before the home stretch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arzúa": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arzúa"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Capitale du fromage galicien. À une journée de Santiago, les pèlerins sentent déjà la fin du chemin.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The capital of Galician cheese. A day from Santiago, pilgrims already sense the journey's end."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "O Pedrouzo": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Pedrouzo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dernière halte avant la ville sainte, dans les bois d'eucalyptus. Demain, Santiago.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last stop before the holy city, through eucalyptus woods. Tomorrow, Santiago."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Monte do Gozo": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Monte do Gozo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le « mont de la joie » : de sa colline, les pèlerins aperçoivent pour la première fois les flèches de la cathédrale.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The ‘hill of joy’: from here, pilgrims catch their first glimpse of the cathedral's spires."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Santiago de Compostela": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Santiago de Compostela"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La cathédrale surgit sur la Plaza del Obradoiro après des semaines de marche. La Compostela est méritée.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The cathedral rises over the Plaza del Obradoiro after weeks of walking. The Compostela is well earned."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Camino Francés — complet": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Camino Francés — Complete"
          }
        }
      }
