      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Montefiascone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sa coupole domine le lac de Bolsena. Le vin « Est! Est!! Est!!! » y aurait été baptisé par un évêque trop gourmand.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Its dome overlooks Lake Bolsena. The wine ‘Est! Est!! Est!!!’ is said to have been named by an overly enthusiastic bishop."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Viterbe": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Viterbo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ancienne résidence des papes au XIIIe siècle, cité médiévale remarquablement conservée dans le Latium.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Former residence of the popes in the 13th century, a remarkably preserved medieval city in Lazio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sutri": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sutri"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cité étrusque creusée dans le tuf, avec son amphithéâtre taillé à même la roche. La porte légendaire du Latium romain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An Etruscan city carved into the tufa rock, with an amphitheater cut straight from the stone. The legendary gateway to Roman Lazio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
