      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La Storta"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dernière halte avant Rome, où saint Ignace eut sa vision. Du Monte Mario voisin, les pèlerins découvrent enfin la coupole de Saint-Pierre.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The last stop before Rome, where Saint Ignatius had his vision. From nearby Monte Mario, pilgrims finally spot the dome of St. Peter's."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rome": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rome"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La basilique Saint-Pierre au bout du chemin. Le pèlerin arrive dans la Ville Éternelle après des semaines de Toscane.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "St. Peter's Basilica at the end of the road. The pilgrim arrives in the Eternal City after weeks through Tuscany."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sentier des Douaniers": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Customs Officers' Path"
          }
        }
      }
    },
